X:1
T:Nobody Knows My Name Here
M:4/4
L:1/8
Q:1/4=118
K:D
%%section Verse 1
D2 E2 F2 GA | B2 A2 F4 |
w: I count the num-bers | on the street |
D2 F2 D2 F2 | E2 G2 F2 E2 |
w: A key, a map, | a bor-rowed town |
D2 E2 F2 G2 | A2 F2 E2 D2 |
w: The pave-ment does | not know my feet |
D2 F2 A2 A2 | B2 A2 F2 D2 |
w: I learn the bus | routes up-side down |
%%section Pre-Chorus 1
G2 AB A2 G2 | F2 E2 FE D2 |
w: The win-dows glow but | none of them say stay |
G2 AB A2 G2 | A2 B2 AG A2 |
w: I prac-tice say-ing | hel-lo to the day |
%%section Chorus
d2 c2 B2 A2 | B2 A2 F2 ED |
w: No-bo-dy knows | my name here yet_ |
d2 d2 c2 B2 | A2 B2 A2 F2 |
w: I'm still a face | they have not met |
d2 c2 B2 A2 | B2 c2 d2 d2 |
w: I've got a key, | I've got a door |
d2 c2 B2 AB | A2 F2 D2 E2 |
w: I set my suit-case | on the floor * |
%%section Verse 2
D2 E2 F2 GA | B2 A2 F4 |
w: The mar-ket o-pens | in the rain |
D2 F2 D2 FE | E2 G2 F4 |
w: I learn the tram stop, | plat-form nine |
D2 E2 F2 G2 | A2 F2 E2 D2 |
w: The ven-dor asks | my name a-gain |
D2 F2 A2 A2 | B2 A2 F2 D2 |
w: And this time it | comes out as mine |
%%section Pre-Chorus 2
G2 AB A2 G2 | F2 E2 D4 |
w: I pin a pho-to | to the wall |
G2 AB A2 G2 | A2 B2 A4 |
w: And wait for some-one | else to call |
%%section Chorus
d2 c2 B2 A2 | B2 A2 F2 ED |
w: No-bo-dy knows | my name here yet_ |
d2 d2 c2 B2 | A2 B2 A2 F2 |
w: I'm still a face | they have not met |
d2 c2 B2 A2 | B2 c2 d2 d2 |
w: I've got a key, | I've got a door |
d2 c2 B2 AB | A2 F2 D2 E2 |
w: I set my suit-case | on the floor * |
%%section Bridge
B2 A2 G2 FE | D2 E2 F2 G2 |
w: May-be some-day this | will all feel old |
G2 A2 B2 cB | A2 G2 F2 E2 |
w: The cor-ner shop will | know my or-der |
E2 F2 G2 A2 | B2 A2 G2 F2 |
w: And when I say | my name I'm told |
E2 F2 G2 AB | c2 B2 A2 A2 |
w: It sounds like some-one | who be-longs here |
%%section Chorus
d2 c2 B2 A2 | B2 A2 F2 ED |
w: No-bo-dy knows | my name here yet_ |
d2 d2 c2 B2 | A2 B2 A2 F2 |
w: I'm still a face | they have not met |
d2 c2 B2 A2 | B2 c2 d2 d2 |
w: I've got a key, | I've got a door |
d2 c2 B2 AB | A2 F2 D2 E2 |
w: I set my suit-case | on the floor * |
